WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.867
At this point we can generate answers, but we still need a disciplined way to decide whether a change is actually

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:10.734
better. Evaluation gives us that discipline.

00:00:11.203 --> 00:00:19.650
We will keep the examples, decoding settings, and rubric fixed so changes in quality can be connected to the model or

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.941
prompt rather than to a changing experiment.
